  anim: {fileID: 1017932555865318465}
  Speak: {fileID: 1384834618}
  typingSpeed: 0.05
  linePause: 1.75
  Text1: 'You can hear me?!/There aren''t many who can./Let me prepare you for what
    to expect./Lets go./ '
  Text2: On my left and right are pickups./Why don't you start by picking them up./After
    that go head and snip the wires behind me./Click numbers 1-5 to access the items
    in your inventory./Opon entry of the building a alarm will sound./Cutting these
    wires will disable that./Give it a try!/
